{
  "_doc": "Left-half patterns on a 32x32 grid. Rows top to bottom, leftmost column first. '#' body, 'a' accent, 'd' shade, 'l' light, '.' clear. top/bottom: the LAST column is the anchor and sits 'dx' cells left of the center axis (column 15); a top part's bottom row sits on the body surface, a bottom part's top row sits under it. side: top row is placed on a body row, last column touching the left edge. tail: drawn only on the RIGHT side after mirroring (so it is asymmetric); the FIRST column touches the body and the bottom row sits on a body row. tone: soft | sharp.",
